.he "touch (1)                    4/6/83                     touch (1)"
.fo "                               -#-"
.in 5
.rm 65
.bd
NAME
.in +5
.br
.bd
touch
- update the modification time for a file
.sp 2
.in -5
.bd
SYNTAX
.in +5
.br
.bd
touch file ...
.sp 2
.in -5
.bd
DESCRIPTION
.in +5
.br
Each of the named files has its modification time set to the
current time.  This is done by reading a character from a file
and then writing it back.  No file's data is changed.
.sp 2
.in -5
.bd
EXAMPLE
.in +5
.br
.bd
touch file
